    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Whether you come from Westcrown or elsewhere, you hold the values of pre-Thrune Cheliax dear. You disdain the infernal government, but you are proud of your country and do not consider yourself a rebel.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Strength or Charisma, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Diplomacy skill and the Westcrown Lore skill. You gain the Group Impression skill feat."
    },
